                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;proverbCard&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;_data/resources/1_1795280004_wall.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;proverbText&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;To bang one&amp;#x27;s head against a brick wall&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;To keep trying to do the impossible. Still said today, almost word for word.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
